   "tests": [
    {
     "id": "source_term_step_one_year",
     "description": "One dt = 1 year source term step from the test-F exact geometry with the dumped forcing (smb_rate, basal_melt_rate, mask; stage1/dumps/geometry/columns.csv): the effective SMB change equals dt*smb/rho_ice exactly at the unclamped cells (no SMB clamping occurs in this trace), the effective BMB change equals -dt*bmr at the icy cells and is clamped to exactly 0 at the ice-free cells (444 cells -- there is no thickness to melt; the truncated melt totals 1.7e-6 m), and H_out_source = H_in_src + dH_SMB + dH_BMB reproduces the dumped H_out_source to round-off (rel 1e-12). The mean of dH_source over the domain reproduces the dumped sum(H_change)/961 (sum(dH_SMB) = 0.0233458 m, sum(dH_BMB) = -1.86362 m, sum = -1.84028 m) to the reduction-order round-off.",
